    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:cad8c23d0530c6f0",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "873edfa636ed6ede194f3b740ef01f88f16b6029decd55dd3c6e7c1369b7768d",
      "text": "Explore the Tambopata River further with a boat ride to the Tres Chimbadas Lake, where you can try to spot giant river otters and other wildlife. You’ll also enjoy the serene beauty of this remote location.\n\nVisit a nearby native village to learn about the traditions, customs, and daily life of the local indigenous communities. Experience cultural exchanges and see local artisans at work. Back at the lodge, relax and enjoy a final dinner, perhaps accompanied by a local performance or storytelling session about Amazonian myths and legends.",
