      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3d0db921b3ae491fcdf4b4a70ecfe224e9587fbe1379410aa587c3852fae844d",
      "text": "After breakfast, enjoy a final, short excursion or nature walk in the early morning to soak in the sounds of the rainforest one last time. If you have time, visit the lodge’s small naturalist shop for unique handicrafts or souvenirs.\n\nTransfer back to the Puerto Maldonado airport by boat and vehicle for your flight. Arrival in Lima, meet with the driver and transfer to the hotel.",
